{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Conquer the Dungeon-ified Gensokyo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a Touhou fan-made roguelike heavily inspired by <i>Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup</i>.<br><br><br>This game is based on a project I created a long time ago, now being improved with localization support, quality-of-life features, additional content, and rebalancing. It will be released as a free game on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601130/extras/bandicam2025-05-2216-48-14-066-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1750947198\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 races, 20 classes, or 9 unique Touhou character starts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">17 small and large dungeons and 10 runes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 types of monsters (including around 80 named Touhou characters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Touhou character deities to worship</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...and the list may keep growing!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601130?t=1750947198","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601130?t=1750947198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601130/943fbd5050824f1b76779da3ceec6042f6cb1180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750947198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601130/943fbd5050824f1b76779da3ceec6042f6cb1180/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750947198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Conquer t